# A token that is a copy of Anticausal Vestige has the ability (CR 707.2), and a token leaving the battlefield is a zone change that
# triggers it (CR 111.7, 603.6c) even though the token ceases to exist. Bot1 hard-casts the Vestige on turn 1 (Black Lotus and three Moxen),
# and on turn 3 plays a second Mountain and casts Kiki-Jiki and copies it; the token is sacrificed at the beginning of the end step, and that leaving makes Bot1 draw
# and put Sol Ring (1 <= 2 lands) onto the battlefield tapped. The original Vestige is untouched and the token is gone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Black Lotus
Anticausal Vestige
Kiki-Jiki, Mirror Breaker
Sol Ring
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

